      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "by substituting for subsection (1c) the following subsection: “(1c) In this section “due date” in relation to any land means— (a) the date of taking possession of the land or a date three months after the service of a notice in Form H referred to in subsection 16(1) in respect of the land, whichever is the earlier; or (b) a date three months after the service of a notice in Form Lc referred to in paragraph 35(2)(c) or Form R referred to in subsection 58(1) or section 59.”; and"
      }
