        "@value": "Section 60 of the principal Act is amended by substituting for the words “ Where the Land Administrator is unable to agree with the persons interested on the amount of compensation” the words “Where the person interested is unable to agree on the amount of compensation offered by the Land Administrator”. Amendment of section 65"
      }
